"id":"478562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"110545","synopsis":"To specify, the ring amplifies the emotions the yokai feels toward its wearer. Using its power, Satoru makes passionate love with Mifuyu, but the next day, he discovers that when he uses the ring, Mifuyu had no memory of what happened.Regardless, Satoru doesn't lose heart, and convincing himself that at least she doesn't hate him, helps rebuild her life. When he hears about Mifuyu's struggle in finding a job, he figures that while being a snow woman may be causing her difficulties, she may have quite an issue with her communication skills…","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12018474/screencap/6acbb51d3b96b.jpg"},{"title":"Package","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"478562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"110756","synopsis":"Satoru becomes Mifuyu's friend in order to help her get used to being around people. They exchange contacts, but as expected, no communication followed. Amidst this, Mifuyu comes to the manager's office. It appears that a package she didn't recognize had been left at her doorstep, so Satoru joins her to check on it at her apartment, Room 503. Upon investigation, it turned out to be a misdelivery. Told by the online retailer to dispose of it, Satoru suggests to Mifuyu that they might as well open it, but…","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12018475/screencap/6ad4f10dc5426.jpg"},{"title":"Fetal Movements","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"478562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"110875","synopsis":"Satoru was racking his brain. As long as he wore the ring, no matter how much they loved each other, Mifuyu wouldn't remember the time she spent with him. To take their relationship to the next level, he had no choice but to express his feelings directly. If only an opportunity arises… Just then, he comes up with an idea: he'd bring the cream puffs Mifuyu had mentioned she wanted to eat, using that as an excuse to share a meal with her. He intended to remove the ring beforehand to prevent it from accidentally activating like it had the other day, but for some reason, the ring had vanished from his finger.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12018476/screencap/6ade29741d11f.jpg"}]},{"id":7863,"path":"/anime/7863-dark-machine-the-animation","info":{"title":"Dark Machine The Animation","synopsis":"Anno 2079. L'umanità vive in una bolla energetica quando il dottor Robert Palmer ha scoperto un cristallo in grado di fornire tutta l'energia di cui le persone hanno bisogno, o addirittura di più di quella necessaria. Purtroppo non tutti possono beneficiare di questa immensa fonte ed enormi battaglie sotterranee si stanno svolgendo su scala globale. I robot che sono stati utilizzati per sviluppare questa nuova tecnologia sono ben presto stati convertiti in mecha da combattimento per riuscire a prevalere in questa battaglia con una grossa posta in palio. Tuttavia si dice che dentro a questi \"cristalli Palmer\" risieda anche una sorta di energia negativa in piccole quantità e che, utilizzando una iper intelligenza artificiale, si stia tentando di usarla per avere vantaggi durante la guerra. Ma attualmente non è chiaro se questa energia oscura possa essere controllata dai mecha...","image":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/480909/posters/6a6f70a78522d.jpg","poster":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/480909/posters/6a6f70a78522d.jpg","logo":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/480909/clearlogo/6acf582d79373.png","background":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/480909/posters/6a6f70a78522d.jpg","trailers":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tvvs_SlUYgA"],"imdbId":"","type":"series","tags":["TV","In Corso","Autunno","2026"],"tagKeys":{"TV":"T